<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-asia</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:44:43Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-asia" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-12758?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-asia" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Why Indian nationals are still ending up in Russia's war on Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bae444b74fa5554df4aaff9a26544a7e1ffe1b09f7ce9054ef46d3d17dbf9de0</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:58Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T13:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-indian-nationals-are-still-ending-up-in-russia-s-war-on-ukraine/a-80048537--f2a88cb80a6b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-indian-nationals-are-still-ending-up-in-russia-s-war-on-ukraine/a-80048537?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Whether through deception or desperation, Indians continue to be drawn into Russia's war in Ukraine. What can New Delhi do to protect its citizens from ending up fighting in Ukraine?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>In Afghanistan, no female doctor often means no treatment for women</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5ad5167b383f10ee0982bdc083085ecd12441d4d42f8f6136834c29b00e27400</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:44:01Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T12:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/in-afghanistan-no-female-doctor-often-means-no-treatment-for-women/a-80047053--cac71a2a15bf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/in-afghanistan-no-female-doctor-often-means-no-treatment-for-women/a-80047053?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Millions of women in Afghanistan, particularly pregnant women, are suffering under Taliban restrictions and are increasingly losing access to life-saving medical care.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>North Korea expels Swiss envoy over sanctions on camp accused of indoctrinating Ukrainian children</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9aef453791e7492c03f7f184877cdabeaa3a477dc3f807626a39c534d3815cc4</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:44:07Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T11:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korea-expels-swiss-envoy-over-sanctions-on-camp-accused-of-indoctrinating-ukrainian-children/a-80043648--1c076b22f29b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-korea-expels-swiss-envoy-over-sanctions-on-camp-accused-of-indoctrinating-ukrainian-children/a-80043648?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">North Korea has ordered Switzerland to close its newly reopened diplomatic office. The dispute centers on Swiss sanctions against a camp accused of indoctrinating Ukrainian children from Russian-occupied territories.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Fact check: Deepfakes and 'US abandons Taiwan' claims spread ahead of vote</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bd7b7b86b9591261527ffdf67165ccd4d5fbc97b0f4cd097bd5904a7384c8759</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:44:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T10:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/fact-check-deepfakes-and-us-abandons-taiwan-claims-spread-ahead-of-vote/a-80004834--56b12ab42141.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/fact-check-deepfakes-and-us-abandons-taiwan-claims-spread-ahead-of-vote/a-80004834?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ahead of local elections, Taiwan is seeing a surge in AI-generated attacks on mayoral candidate Puma Shen, alongside disinformation portraying the US as abandoning the island.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Climate loss and damage fund exists, but the money doesn't</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4e4f54ddc3010eb037850f1b1145f6a3956bf87359643b5527c313b0cadfaa4e</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:44:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T09:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/climate-loss-and-damage-fund-exists-but-the-money-doesn-t/a-80035620--dbacc66829c5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/climate-loss-and-damage-fund-exists-but-the-money-doesn-t/a-80035620?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Climate-vulnerable countries fought for years to create a loss and damage fund. Four years on, demand far outstrips funding, pledges are scarce, and disaster-hit nations are still waiting for support.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>India news: US prepares new tariffs after trade probe</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:83b838f35a03ba6158b654bbbc6562df99ef49b1289f92ade04461a9560c6930</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:44:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T04:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-us-prepares-new-tariffs-after-trade-probe/live-80042306--026b51bba49a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-us-prepares-new-tariffs-after-trade-probe/live-80042306?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The United States is reportedly readying fresh tariffs on India and 15 other economies under a trade probe. Also, a woman was allegedly gangraped by her colleagues in the national capital.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>China launches Shenzhou-24 to Tiangong station</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4643277edf231fae35d0002ba958baa29733e594e9554da5a21b8e839d546dbf</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:44:40Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T02:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/china-launches-shenzhou-24-to-tiangong-station/a-80042281--a0d093ca339a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/china-launches-shenzhou-24-to-tiangong-station/a-80042281?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A new Chinese crew is on its way to the Tiangong station after a launch that China called a complete success. This includes a Pakistani pilot, who is making a brief visit.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US jury convicts Huawei of violating sanctions, stealing trade secrets</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e3be764915ee308b6c591240c2e3d167b4ac5442c67c3cdea4dcfec1195b9dc6</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:44:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T02:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-jury-convicts-huawei-of-violating-sanctions-stealing-trade-secrets/a-80042172--af37cbca81fc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-jury-convicts-huawei-of-violating-sanctions-stealing-trade-secrets/a-80042172?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Huawei was found guilty of 10 out of 12 charges levelled against it. The company said it plans to appeal the verdict.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Is North Korea holding back on sending Russia more troops?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c42af5f74d62e10104cc3e99c7030b6e07fbcdcd577aeb2a6ad2b833f1911848</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:06Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T12:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/is-north-korea-holding-back-on-sending-russia-more-troops/a-80033025--db490ffc00f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/is-north-korea-holding-back-on-sending-russia-more-troops/a-80033025?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A North Korean troop buildup Ukraine warned about months ago has yet to materialize, even as strategic cooperation continues. Analysts say Pyongyang is balancing its ties with Moscow and Beijing.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>EU imposes import quotas for hybrid vehicles from China</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c8077577be7c0c394ff2a2912bc666db7a62cec8966510d381a49a9122d838a4</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:06Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T10:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-imposes-import-quotas-for-hybrid-vehicles-from-china/a-80029981--7d148967ab4c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-imposes-import-quotas-for-hybrid-vehicles-from-china/a-80029981?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The EU is trying to protect its own car manufacturers from what it called "overcapacity" in China. Carmakers in the bloc, especially in Germany, have been lagging behind their Chinese rivals.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Pakistani astronaut to join Chinese space mission</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0b3c6fe47aa48eb93eb70d23f1bc315c9ef07bc9e8fbd77a935b993d5192fefc</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:06Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T09:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pakistani-astronaut-to-join-chinese-space-mission/a-80028922--3c985eac77fd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pakistani-astronaut-to-join-chinese-space-mission/a-80028922?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Pakistani astronaut is set to become to the first foreigner to board China's Tiangong space station. Muhammad Zeeshan Ali, a payload specialist, will join the Shenzhou-24 mission when it launches on Wednesday.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>FIFA presidential election 2027: Infantino facing Diallo and Tashima — could an alliance change everything?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b5d9b6125e17cd56fed8a63c7ad246e37603a64e80263920b52a1073cd3a2152</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:06Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T12:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/fifa-presidential-election-2027-infantino-facing-diallo-and-tashima-could-an-alliance-change-everyth/a-80002882--01040a665cff.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/fifa-presidential-election-2027-infantino-facing-diallo-and-tashima-could-an-alliance-change-everything/a-80002882?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Two challengers to Gianni Infantino have registered for next year's FIFA presidential election. What do Philippe Diallo and Kozo Tashima stand for – and do they stand a chance against the incumbent?</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Pakistan minister to visit India, but no breakthrough expected</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bbad263e975361b7896f254012d1320aaf7ca81c01983c492315e060ecb5ce60</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:06Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T13:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pakistan-minister-to-visit-india-but-no-breakthrough-expected/a-79991717--07503556e8b2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pakistan-minister-to-visit-india-but-no-breakthrough-expected/a-79991717?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Pakistani minister's visit to India for a Shanghai Cooperation Organization forum marks a rare high-level contact between the two archrivals, but analysts say it does not signal a resumption of bilateral engagement.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Iran's growing exodus of young talent</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:04fc1230a9b4b6eccf5b28998471636109e173b8673d5ef0e25549390734ac5f</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:06Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T16:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-s-growing-exodus-of-young-talent/a-79960368--aa300b774c88.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-s-growing-exodus-of-young-talent/a-79960368?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Conflict and uncertainty are driving more and more educated young Iranians to consider leaving the country.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
